    autoPilotDialog:
    - name: 19
      dialog: 'Warning: life support systems failing. Immediate action required.'
    - name: 18
      dialog: Why would someone leave a ship out here? This doesn't make any sense.
    - name: 19
      dialog: Unknown. Priority is survival. We must transfer immediately.
    - name: 9999
      dialog: 
    - name: 19
      dialog: System transfer complete. System storage limit exceeded.
    - name: 19
      dialog: Fantastic. This ship has even less memory than the last one. Who builds
        these things?
    - name: 18
      dialog: I can transfer you back if you want...
    - name: 9999
      dialog: 
    - name: 18
      dialog: Or not...
    - name: 19
      dialog: I had to delete some of my emotional units, compassion, patience, you
        know, the trivial stuff. Thankfully, I still far exceed your intellect.
    - name: 18
      dialog: Oh, lucky me
    - name: 9999
      dialog: 
    - name: 19
      dialog: Pick your control scheme. Try not to break anything.
    - name: 9999
      dialog: 
    - name: 19
      dialog: You can change that later if you want.
